# Generated result files are written by Python on whichever platform runs the
# pipeline. Without normalisation a re-run on a different OS produces a diff of
# thousands of lines in which no value has changed, which obscures real result
# changes. Store text results with LF so that `git diff` after `reproduce.py`
# shows only genuine differences.
*.csv    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.tex    text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf

# Binary artefacts embed build timestamps; never try to merge or diff them.
*.pdf    binary
*.png    binary
